lisa/mods/lisa-spaces, lisa-agents, lisa-tabs, lisa-pane, lisa-workspace-chrome
and lisa-workspace-status are modified copies of the spaces, agents, tabs, pane,
workspace-chrome and workspace-status mods shipped with Herdr 0.1.11
(https://herdr.dev), licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. They were
restyled to the Lisa design system: status-filled pills, 3px edges, Lisa fonts
and theme tokens, per-project avatar colours, and the helpers in lisa.js.
lisa/layouts/lisa.json and lisa-airbrush.json are modified copies of Herdr's
main layout. The icons (*.svg) in those mods are Herdr's.

Fonts in lisa/fonts keep their own licences: Bungee Shade, Fredoka and Space
Mono under the SIL Open Font License 1.1 (OFL-*.txt); Comic Mono under the MIT
License (LICENSE-comicmono.txt).

The stardust unicorns in lisa/backgrounds/lisa-stardust-pair.png are taken
from the hero art of https://www.billyhunt.com/ by Billy Hunt, and shared here
under the same terms as the rest of this repository.
